    {
      "id": "p0158-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because of this intentional ambiguity - and the fact that the English word \"waterfall\" isn't commonly known in Japanese - this location was named ''Waterland\" as a temporary placeholder. The localization tean1 later settled on the name ''Waterfell\", which brought it closer to the original name, while \"sounding\" like the name of a place.",
        "raw": "Because of this intentional ambiguity\n- and the fact that the English word\n\"waterfall\" isn't commonly known in\nJapanese - this location was named\n''Waterland\" as a temporary placeholder.\nThe localization tean1 later settled on\nthe name ''Waterfell\", which brought\nit closer to the original name, while\n\"sounding\" like the name of a place.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.60845993,
          0.4114,
          0.90560484,
          0.56946429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
